{"name":"Maharaja","hex":"#3f354f","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"maharaja","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A Hindu monarch ranking above a raja, an emperor."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/maharaja"}],"entries":[{"title":"Maharaja","blocks":[{"text":"Maharaja is a royal title in the Indian subcontinent of Sanskrit origin. In modern India and medieval northern India, the title was equivalent to a prince. However, in late ancient India and medieval south India, the title denoted a king."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Maharaja","wikidata":"Q1163330"},{"title":"Maharaja (2024 film)","blocks":[{"text":"Maharaja is a 2024 Indian Tamil -language neo-noir action thriller film directed by Nithilan Saminathan. Produced by The Route, Think Studios and Passion Studios, the film stars Vijay Sethupathi, alongside Anurag Kashyap and Sachana Namidass. The story follows a barber in Chennai who goes to the police station to retrieve his stolen dustbin, only for the police to find his intentions to be something else."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/8/82/Maharaja_2024_film_poster.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Maharaja_(2024_film)","wikidata":"Q126595889"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/ba/Maharaj_Ranjit_Singh.jpg/500px-Maharaj_Ranjit_Singh.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/ba/Maharaj_Ranjit_Singh.jpg/1280px-Maharaj_Ranjit_Singh.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/ba/Maharaj_Ranjit_Singh.jpg/500px-Maharaj_Ranjit_Singh.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Ranjit Singh, first Maharaja of the Sikh Empire","link":"https://en.wik